#: ../../../AMDGPUUsage.rst:1729
msgid "llvm.amdgcn.global.load.monitor"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../AMDGPUUsage.rst:1729
msgid ""
"Available on GFX12.5 only. Corresponds to ``global_load_monitor_b32/64/128`` "
"(``.b32/64/128`` suffixes) instructions. For the purposes of the memory "
"model, this is an atomic load operation in the global address space."
